{'symbol': 'DHR', 'date': '2022-04-21 06:00:00', 'title': 'DANAHER REPORTS FIRST QUARTER 2022 RESULTS', 'text': 'WASHINGTON , APRIL 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DANAHER CORPORATION (NYSE: DHR) (THE "COMPANY") TODAY ANNOUNCED RESULTS FOR THE FIRST QUARTER 2022. FOR THE QUARTER ENDED APRIL 1, 2022, NET EARNINGS WERE $1.7 BILLION, OR $2.31 PER DILUTED COMMON SHARE WHICH REPRESENTS A 1.0% INCREASE OVER THE COMPARABLE 2021 PERIOD.'}